# PlayButton: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_PlayButton.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
shot play
note Material: play is a primary rounded square while playing
ptr glide 960 130 200
rec morph 1 ptr click
note it springs into a circle when paused
ptr click
